# Copy to .env.tailscale (mode 0600, never commit it). Read only by the Tailscale sidecar, never
# by the gateway. Create the key in the Tailscale admin console (Settings > Keys): not ephemeral,
# pre-approved, tag:t6-gateway. It is needed once; after enrollment the file may be empty but
# must still exist. docs/tailscale-sidecar-runbook.md has the full steps.
TS_AUTHKEY=
